 <h3><u>asghar haaye asghar</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><big>ay mere asghare bezabaan<br>tujhe dhundne jaawun kahaan<br>asghar haaye asghar asghar haaye asghar <br><br>ay che mahine waale tujhko mera salaam<br>asghar haaye asghar asghar haaye asghar<br><br>ay shaahedeen ke dilbar<br>ay ruhe qalbe maadar<br>ay tashnakaam asghar<br>ay bezabaan asghar<br><br>shikwa na karna asghar<br>paani nahi mayassar<br>aansu bahake maine<br>turbat ko kar diya tar<br><br>tashnaalabi pe teri<br>giryaan hai ye khudaayi<br>mazlumiyat ne teri<br>insaaniyat jagaayi<br><br>baanu bhi ro rahi hai<br>kis darja bekasi hai<br>asghar teri lahad par<br>khud maut keh rahi hai<br><br>pucho ali ziya se<br>irfan karbala se<br>baanu ke dil ko denge<br>ye lafz hi dilaase <br><br>taarikhe karbala ko<br>parh kar anees dekho <br>dushman bhi sar jhukaaye<br>kehte milenge tumko<br><br>ay che mahine waale tujhko mera salaam<br>asghar haaye asghar asghar haaye asghar</big></p> 
